ighs and the darkest depths of the city, discovering her own destiny in the place where the last free people live.\n\nWhite Shadows is a cinematic puzzle platformer -- immerse yourself in a unique, handcrafted dystopia where equal parts entertainment and social criticism form the weirdest playing experience of the year!", "summary": "White Shadows is a modern fable about escaping a dark, weird and violent world.\nA long time has passed since The Great War. Humanity is half human, half animal. What remains of civilization lives in The White City, a vast network of towers rising high into a dark sky.\n\nTo protect against a deadly pandemic, those who can afford it try to keep themselves alive - by covering their skin in bright white light. Follow Ravengirl as she is trying to escape this huge city, its deadly traps and weird trials. To set herself free, Ravengirl needs to find her way into the brightest highs and the darkest depths of the city, to a mythical place called Tin Town, where the last free people live.\u200b", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}, {"id": 23, "name": "Stealth"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/white-shadows", "videos": [{"id": 40125, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "N-0pRj9-dVI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=N-0pRj9-dVI", "title": "White Shadows - Announce Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/N-0pRj9-dVI/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 50815, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "nDdNn4q1uJk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nDdNn4q1uJk", "title": "White Shadows - Gameplay Trailer | Summer of Gaming 2021", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/nDdNn4q1uJk/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 60763, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "ZXxSladVCLY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZXxSladVCLY", "title": "White Shadows - Release Date Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ZXxSladVCLY/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}